"id":"a-jin059-volume-wang-zhang-brother","subject_person_id":"6zv_a72_yxd","object_person_id":"tyf_qc0_xq2","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"王彌弟璋"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-yue-ws2650517","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009","quote":"越專擅威權，圖為霸業，朝賢素望，選為佐吏，名將勁卒，充於己府，不臣之跡，四海所知。而公私罄乏，所在寇亂，州郡攜貳，上下崩離，禍結釁深，遂憂懼成疾。永嘉五年，薨于項。秘不發喪。以襄陽王范為大將軍，統其眾。還葬東海。石勒追及于苦縣甯平城，將軍錢端出兵距勒，戰死，軍潰。勒命焚越柩曰：「此人亂天下，吾為天下報之，故燒其骨以告天地。」於是數十萬眾，勒以騎圍而射之，相踐如山。王公士庶死者十餘萬。王彌弟璋焚其餘眾，並食之。天下歸罪於越。帝發詔貶越為縣王。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009:m0196","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009:m0193"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"同段明具弟。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009:m0196","surface":"璋","start":196,"end":197,"person_id":"6zv_a72_yxd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin059-volume-wang-zhang-brother","subject_person_id":"6zv_a72_yxd","object_person_id":"tyf_qc0_xq2","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"王彌弟璋"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-prince-yue-ws2650517","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009","quote":"越專擅威權，圖為霸業，朝賢素望，選為佐吏，名將勁卒，充於己府，不臣之跡，四海所知。而公私罄乏，所在寇亂，州郡攜貳，上下崩離，禍結釁深，遂憂懼成疾。永嘉五年，薨于項。秘不發喪。以襄陽王范為大將軍，統其眾。還葬東海。石勒追及于苦縣甯平城，將軍錢端出兵距勒，戰死，軍潰。勒命焚越柩曰：「此人亂天下，吾為天下報之，故燒其骨以告天地。」於是數十萬眾，勒以騎圍而射之，相踐如山。王公士庶死者十餘萬。王彌弟璋焚其餘眾，並食之。天下歸罪於越。帝發詔貶越為縣王。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009:m0196","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p0